# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to a context-root
# .dockerignore, which is why this sits next to the Dockerfile instead of at the
# repo root: the context IS the repo root (vendor/, build/, examples/ - gigabytes
# of it), and the image build needs a handful of files out of it.
*
!tools/ps2link/tyrax.patch
!docker/openvcl-tyrax.patch
# The audsrv fork's EE half is COMPILED into this image: its libaudsrv.a has to
# come from this image's own toolchain (the committed one carries the stock
# image's LTO bytecode). bin/audsrv.irx is copied in as it is - an IOP module
# is embedded as data, never linked by the EE compiler.
!vendor/tyra/audsrv/ee
!vendor/tyra/audsrv/bin/audsrv.irx
